---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import MissionGraph from '../../components/MissionGraph.astro';
---

<Base title="The Mission: Sanctioned Insurrection | Word And Mouth" description="The intellectual boundaries of our work. Innovation is rebellion.">
  <div class="mission-container">
    
    <header class="mission-header">
      <span class="system-label">STRATEGIC_DIRECTIVE_001</span>
      <h1>The Insurrection</h1>
      <p class="mission-intro">
        You cannot innovate inside the machine that was built to standardize you.
        <br>
        To build the future, **you must leave the building.**
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="graph-column">
        <MissionGraph />
      </div>
      
      <div class="manifesto-column">
        <section class="manifesto-block">
          <h2>The Corporate Immune System</h2>
          <p>Every large organisation has an immune system. Its job is to detect "variance" (risk, inefficiency, new ideas) and eliminate it to protect the Core Business.</p>
          <p>That is why your Innovation Lab failed. That is why your "Transformation" is just new slides for old meetings.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="manifesto-block">
          <h2>The Only Way Out</h2>
          <p>To survive, you must establish a <strong>Special Projects Team (SPT)</strong> that operates outside the immune system. A sanctioned insurrection.</p>
          <p>This Knowledge Graph defines the conditions required to pull that off.</p>
          <ul class="node-list">
            <li><strong>HIRING:</strong> How to recruit Pirates (Intrapreneurs) without spooking HR.</li>
            <li><strong>COACHING:</strong> Deprogramming executives to lead, not manage, chaos.</li>
            <li><strong>EXECUTION:</strong> The "100-Day War" protocol for speed and validation.</li>
            <li><strong>STRUCTURE:</strong> Designing the "Air Gap" and metered funding models.</li>
            <li><strong>ENVIRONMENT:</strong> Creating the Psychological Safety required for failure.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="action-block">
          <p>This is the configuration for a Special Projects Team.</p>
          <a href="/mission/hiring" class="cta-button">Configure Your Team →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .mission-container {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .system-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .mission-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mission-intro {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #ccc;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .mission-intro strong {
    color: #fff;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .manifesto-block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .manifesto-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #333;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .manifesto-block p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .node-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #222;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #0f0f0f;
  }

  .node-list li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .node-list strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
  }

  .node-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .action-block {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .action-block p {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(5px);
  }

</style>
